.TH SCHED_RR_GET_INTERVAL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_rr_get_interval \- reads the round-robin scheduling quantum for a thread
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_rr_get_interval(pid_t process, struct timespec* interval);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads the round-robin scheduling quantum for a thread.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_rr_get_interval (2)
